{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/extras/e0f72d7751f69509ccebad67974cf9b6.avif?t=1754355688\" width=1232 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a nameless space station built around a strange Object of unknown purpose. Collect ProtoCores hidden behind intricate tile-switching puzzles in silent rooms. Along the way, shifting crew logs blur memory and reality, leaving you to wonder\u2014are you uncovering the truth, or creating it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/extras/18c6e50c6d772318f7e3a7175a298b8c.avif?t=1754355688\" width=1232 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station is locked tight, every room sealed with a puzzle. They\u2019re quiet at first\u2014grids of tiles that flip and shift when you jump on them. Simple patterns become tangled, twisting into layered logic that demands focus. Solve one, earn a ProtoCore. Each challenge brings you closer to the truth, revealing fragments of the crew\u2019s mysterious experiences and the station\u2019s hidden purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/extras/a52b8640b549fd8f86ef1976fa620b4c.avif?t=1754355688\" width=1232 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between the puzzles, you find logs. Fragments of voices from a crew that lived here before you\u2026 or maybe after. Their stories are tangled with your reality, looping back on themselves in ways you might not expect. The logs start reacting to your actions, and the line between memory and reality begins to blur. And as you listen, the station itself seems to notice. Is it showing you the truth\u2014or rewriting it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/extras/d1c7683405c800f643394c457a6f1650.avif?t=1754355688\" width=1232 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each solved room moves you deeper into the story. You repeat the cycles and solve more complex puzzles only to find more questions than answers. Don\u2019t despair.\u00a0 Keep going. Collect, unlock, descend. Until you reach the final room. The final solution. Is it The Answer you came for? Or just another Question, waiting to be asked again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, this is a solo-developed indie game, brought to life with the support of some truly amazing people who have contributed not just their time, but their passion as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672210?t=1754355688","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/efb74cc2ee55750ef449b2a8e00a1d447279e4ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754355688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/5f499b5fa44ffd159a81949cca2b4d1e7b349249/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754355688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/5f499b5fa44ffd159a81949cca2b4d1e7b349249/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754355688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/extras/e0f72d7751f69509ccebad67974cf9b6.avif?t=1754355688\" width=1232 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a nameless space station built around a strange Object of unknown purpose. Collect ProtoCores hidden behind intricate tile-switching puzzles in silent rooms. Along the way, shifting crew logs blur memory and reality, leaving you to wonder\u2014are you uncovering the truth, or creating it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/extras/18c6e50c6d772318f7e3a7175a298b8c.avif?t=1754355688\" width=1232 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station is locked tight, every room sealed with a puzzle. They\u2019re quiet at first\u2014grids of tiles that flip and shift when you jump on them. Simple patterns become tangled, twisting into layered logic that demands focus. Solve one, earn a ProtoCore. Each challenge brings you closer to the truth, revealing fragments of the crew\u2019s mysterious experiences and the station\u2019s hidden purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/extras/a52b8640b549fd8f86ef1976fa620b4c.avif?t=1754355688\" width=1232 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between the puzzles, you find logs. Fragments of voices from a crew that lived here before you\u2026 or maybe after. Their stories are tangled with your reality, looping back on themselves in ways you might not expect. The logs start reacting to your actions, and the line between memory and reality begins to blur. And as you listen, the station itself seems to notice. Is it showing you the truth\u2014or rewriting it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672210/extras/d1c7683405c800f643394c457a6f1650.avif?t=1754355688\" width=1232 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each solved room moves you deeper into the story. You repeat the cycles and solve more complex puzzles only to find more questions than answers. Don\u2019t despair.\u00a0 Keep going. Collect, unlock, descend. Until you reach the final room. The final solution. Is it The Answer you came for? Or just another Question, waiting to be asked again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, this is a solo-developed indie game, brought to life with the support of some truly amazing people who have contributed not just their time, but their passion as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["HellYeah!"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s